 the commands run from this repo: router configs live here, scenarios/ is where you save each scenario\ngit clone --depth 1 https://github.com/inference-sim/blis-config-search.git && cd blis-config-search && mkdir -p scenarios\n\n# the replay corpus (not vendored anywhere; checked against its digest)\nmkdir -p .corpus\n# fetch the corpus to .corpus/traces.jsonl (see SETUP.md)\necho \"29b6a19e751ff5230771519aab755f80a0f43a4ba9cf96b72d3a6a437ec99276  .corpus/traces.jsonl\" | shasum -a 256 -c\n","stack":[{"commit":null,"name":"BLIS","ref":"v0.18.2","repo":"inference-sim"},{"commit":null,"name":"substrate (embedded data)","ref":"v0.15.1-0.20261118162118-b6748ca9d757","repo":"blis-substrate"},{"commit":null,"name":"router","ref":"v1.0.0-blis.5.0.20261118163949-601ff6e9d37d","repo":"llm-d-router"}],"sweep":"# in the blis-config-search checkout, after the install script\npython3 -m venv .venv && . .venv/bin/activate && pip install pyyaml\npython3 -I scripts/run_experiment.py reports/deepseek-v4-1-flash-b200-agentx-4node/spec.yaml --dry-run --catalog \"$SUBSTRATE_CATALOG\"\npython3 -I scripts/run_experiment.py reports/deepseek-v4-1-flash-b200-agentx-4node/spec.yaml \\\n  --blis \"$(command -v blis)\" --catalog \"$SUBSTRATE_CATALOG\" --registry \"$SUBSTRATE_REGISTRY\" \\\n  --out repro/\n"},"slo":{"itl_p99":"20ms"},"spec_yaml":"name: deepseek-v4-1-flash-b200-agentx-4node\nscenario:\n  model: deepseek-v4.1-flash\n  hardware: b200\n  cluster:\n    gpus_per_node: 8\n  workload_spec: workloads/agentx-run-recipe.yaml\n  gpus: 32\n  slo:\n    itl_p99: 20ms\n  engine:\n    cache_dtype: fp8_ds_mla\n    max_model_len: 262144\n  concurrency:\n  - 32\n  - 64\n  - 128\n  replay:\n    corpus: .corpus/traces.jsonl\n    corpus_cache: /tmp/agx-cache-b200\nsweeps:\n- name: topology-ep\n  narrative: Mid-width tp4 instances should win at the SLO, and EP should matter little\n    at dp 1 but cost throughput once dp spreads experts wider.\n  num-instances:\n  - 2\n  - 4\n  - 8\n  - 16\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 2\n    - 4\n    - 8\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    - 2\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n    - false\n- name: batch-tokens\n  narrative: The per-step token cap should bind harder on four wide instances than\n    on eight narrow ones, since long agentic prompts concentrate per instance.\n  num-instances:\n  - 4\n  - 8\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 8\n    - 4\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    max_num_batched_tokens:\n    - 2048\n    - 4096\n- name: prefill-chunking\n  narrative: Capping prefill chunks should cost throughput at both widths, more where\n    fewer decodes share each instance's token budget.\n  num-instances:\n  - 4\n  - 8\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 8\n    - 4\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    long_prefill_token_threshold:\n    - 2048\n- name: kv-capacity\n  narrative: nvfp4 KV and a higher memory fraction both buy cache, so on a prefix-heavy\n    replay they should substitute rather than add.\n  num-instances:\n  - 2\n  - 4\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 16\n    - 8\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    cache_dtype:\n    - fp8_ds_mla\n    - nvfp4_ds_mla\n    gpu_memory_utilization:\n    - 0.8\n    - 0.95\n- name: moe-collective\n  narrative: A DeepEP backend should beat the allgather default at EP 16, and the\n    gap should shrink or flip at EP 4.\n  num-instances:\n  - 8\n  - 2\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 4\n    - 8\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    - 2\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    all2all_backend:\n    - deepep_high_throughput\n    - deepep_low_latency\n    - deepep_v2\n    - pplx\n- name: drafting\n  narrative: dspark should raise throughput more on narrow instances, while K=5 may\n    push wide shapes past the 20ms ITL floor.\n  num-instances:\n  - 4\n  - 8\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 8\n    - 4\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    speculative:\n      method:\n      - dspark\n      num_spec_tokens:\n      - 1\n      - 3\n      - 5\n- name: routing-prefix-cache\n  narrative: Prefix-affinity with caching on should lead and random with caching off\n    trail, and the gap should widen from four instances to eight.\n  num-instances:\n  - 4\n  - 8\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 8\n    - 4\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    enable_prefix_caching:\n    - true\n    - false\n  router:\n    endpoint_picker_config:\n    - random.yaml\n    - load-aware.yaml\n    - queue-kv.yaml\n    - prefix-affinity.yaml\n- name: cudagraph\n  narrative: Full capture should edge out the PIECEWISE default by a few percent.\n  num-instances:\n  - 8\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 4\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    cudagraph_mode:\n    - FULL\n    - FULL_DECODE_ONLY\n    - FULL_AND_PIECEWISE\n","sweeps":[{"configs":12,"dropped":[{"count":2,"gpus":4,"reason":"uses 4 GPUs, not the scenario's 32"},{"count":6,"gpus":8,"reason":"uses 8 GPUs, not the scenario's 32"},{"count":10,"gpus":16,"reason":"uses 16 GPUs, not the scenario's 32"},{"count":10,"gpus":64,"reason":"uses 64 GPUs, not the scenario's 32"},{"count":6,"gpus":128,"reason":"uses 128 GPUs, not the scenario's 32"},{"count":2,"gpus":256,"reason":"uses 256 GPUs, not the scenario's 32"}],"name":"topology-ep","narrative":"Mid-width tp4 instances should win at the SLO, and EP should matter little at dp 1 but cost throughput once dp spreads experts wider.","spec":{"num-instances":[2,4,8,16],"parallel":{"dp":[1,2],"enable_expert_parallel":[true,false],"tp":[2,4,8]}}},{"configs":4,"dropped":[{"count":2,"gpus":16,"reason":"uses 16 GPUs, not the scenario's 32"},{"count":2,"gpus":64,"reason":"uses 64 GPUs, not the scenario's 32"}],"name":"batch-tokens","narrative":"The per-step token cap should bind harder on four wide instances than on eight narrow ones, since long agentic prompts concentrate per instance.","spec":{"engine":{"max_num